WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.758
LETITIA WRIGHT
Hey everyone!

00:00:00.808 --> 00:00:02.417
We're the cast of...

00:00:04.431 --> 00:00:05.755
WINSTON DUKE
And it's time for one of my

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.099
favorite parts of the job.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.552
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Unboxing some really cool products

00:00:09.602 --> 00:00:10.544
 inspired by the film.

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:11.594
[Gasping]

00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:13.909
[Laughing]

00:00:14.183 --> 00:00:15.274
LETITIA WRIGHT
Oooh!

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:16.705
WINSTON/DANAI
Oooh!

00:00:16.756 --> 00:00:18.684
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
Look at this!

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.885
I want to have this body!
[Laughing]

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:22.409
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Whoa! [Laughing]

00:00:22.459 --> 00:00:23.193
Funko Pop!

00:00:23.243 --> 00:00:24.121
[Laughing]

00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:25.037
Mah fah...

00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:26.427
Your head size matches.

00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:28.784
[Laughing]

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:30.042
RIRI WILLIAMS
Go!

00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:32.576
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Got the removable visor!

00:00:32.627 --> 00:00:35.157
LETITIA WRIGHT
So this is an aircraft called a Sunbird,

00:00:35.207 --> 00:00:36.567
created by Shuri.

00:00:36.878 --> 00:00:39.565
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
My throne! Bend your knees!

00:00:40.068 --> 00:00:42.901
DOMINIQUE THORNE
Oh! That is incredible!

00:00:43.185 --> 00:00:44.471
LETITIA WRIGHT
Kimoyo Beads!

00:00:44.521 --> 00:00:48.535
The detail, the Wakandan language...
I love it. I'm taking this home.

00:00:48.586 --> 00:00:49.691
TENOCH HUERTA MEJÍA
I can keep it, right?

00:00:49.742 --> 00:00:50.771
DANAI GURIRA
Come on girl, let's get out of here.

00:00:51.373 --> 00:00:52.144
WINSTON DUKE
Wow!

00:00:52.195 --> 00:00:52.786
SHURI
Yes!

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:55.777
LETITIA WRIGHT
Make sure to go and see our new film...

